            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omusaayi Aruni aniina khu sikulu sia Hori khulwe lilaka lia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, mala afwilayo khu mwiiko kwe kamakhumi kane enyuma we Baisiraeli khurura e Misiri. Aafwa khu ndaalo eye khunyoa eye kumwesi kwa kharaano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
